      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sentinel Hub Process API(bouregrag)\nFetch satellite imagerie(True color / NDWI / SWIR) from  [Sentinel hub ](https://www.sentinel-hub.com/)",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 880
